## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to combine TLS edge proxying with per-tenant feature gates loaded from a daemon-managed config source. It also checks bootstrap discipline in a two-DC setup.

## Key Concepts
- Docker Configs for runtime config
- TLS termination at Nginx edge proxy
- Per-tenant feature gates in a small API
- Simple bootstrap for tenants and flags

## Code Example
```javascript
const fs = require('fs');
const yaml = require('js-yaml');
const express = require('express');
const app = express();
let flags = {};
function loadFlags() {
  const txt = fs.readFileSync('/etc/feature-flags.yaml','utf8');
  flags = yaml.load(txt) || {};
}
loadFlags();
app.get('/health-quiz', (req, res) => {
  const tenant = req.headers['x-tenant-id'];
  if (tenant && flags[tenant] && flags[tenant].enabled) res.sendStatus(200);
  else res.sendStatus(403);
});
app.listen(3000);
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test this gating with CI and two data centers?
- What are failure modes if the config-loader container is unavailable?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests knowledge of per-tenant routing, docker configs, and zero-downtime reconfiguration in a multi-DC setup.

## Key Concepts
- Traefik dynamic config and weighted routing
- Docker Configs for per-tenant policy
- TLS termination at edge proxy
- Multi-DC docker-dca deployment basics
- Observability of per-tenant routing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Traefik dynamic config snippet (example)
{
  "http": {
    "routers": {
      "tenant-ab": {
        "rule": "Host(`api.local`)",
        "tls": { "certResolver": "myresolver" },
        "service": "ab-backend"
      }
    },
    "services": {
      "ab-backend": {
        "loadBalancer": {
          "weighted": {
            "services": [
              { "name": "api-v1", "weight": 80 },
              { "name": "api-v2", "weight": 20 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test per-tenant weight changes in production?
- How would you handle missing or malformed ab-split entries?
- How would you monitor skew and rollback strategies?
